Description: GTK3 comic book viewer (Python 3 port)
 MComix3 is a user-friendly, customizable comic book image viewer.
 It is specifically designed to handle comic books (both Western
 comics and manga) and supports a variety of container formats
 including CBR, CBZ, CB7, CBT, LHA and PDF.
 .
 MComix3 is a fork of MComix, ported to Python 3 and GTK3.
